<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NAB appoints retail chief.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NAB appoints retail chief.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Ltd (NAB) said on Tuesday it has appointed Alan Frankenburg as general manager, retail financial services in Australia.</p>
<p>Frankenburg was formerly chief operating officer of the Michigan National Corp, acquired by NAB in 1995.</p>
<p>He succeeds Grahame Savage, appointed last month as chief executive of NAB subsidiaries, Northern Bank in Northern Ireland and National Irish Bank in the Irish Republic.</p>
<p>Frankenburg would take up his position in April.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
